<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="gear-before-raiding">Gear you can aim for before raiding</h3>There are certain gear pieces that generally do not fit into this guide as they aren't truly considered pre-bis as they require <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>. However it is possible to get them from weekly heroic dungeons as well, so this section will be dedicated to them.<br/>
<br/>You can gain 1600 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> every week from doing 7 heroics, and you can do them in a single day. As a balance druid, you will want to get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60283/stormriders-leggings">
<img alt="Stormrider's Leggings" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormrider's Leggings</span></a>.  In addition <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58484/fading-violet-sandals">
<img alt="Fading Violet Sandals" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fading Violet Sandals</span></a> are BoE boots that are sold for 1650 valor, having an alt farm you the required valor for these boots or buying them off the auction house is also an upgrade that should be considered if you want to maximize your gear before raids. Last you should also grab a relic with your legs. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64672/relic-of-norgannon">
<img alt="Relic of Norgannon" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_stonetablet_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Norgannon</span></a> is recommended but <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64673/relic-of-eonar">
<img alt="Relic of Eonar" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_elemental_mote_life01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Eonar</span></a> can be bought if you are really desperate for hit. It is worth trying to do Baradin Hold first before buying any tier legs or gloves as they can drop there as well.<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Balance Druid DPS</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-balance-druid-dps">Head for Balance Druid DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59453/camouflage-bio-optic-killshades">
<img alt="Camouflage Bio-Optic Killshades" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_newgoggles.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Camouflage Bio-Optic Killshades</span></a> requires engineering but is an incredibly good item you will keep until you can get tier head. For non-engineers you will want <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58150/cluster-of-stars">
<img alt="Cluster of Stars" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_193.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cluster of Stars</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62367/arcanum-of-hyjal">
<img alt="Arcanum of Hyjal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Hyjal</span></a>, requires Revered reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1158/guardians-of-hyjal">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Guardians of Hyjal</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
