<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet-for-balance-druid-dps">Feet for Balance Druid DPS</h4>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56277/decapod-slippers">
<img alt="Decapod Slippers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_chain_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Decapod Slippers</span></a> are your best boots. However a pair of boots with identical stats may be obtained from <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=50086/tarvus-the-vile">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Tarvus the Vile</span></a> in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=4922/twilight-highlands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Twilight Highlands</span></a>, the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67245/tarvuss-poison-scarred-boots">
<img alt="Tarvus's Poison-Scarred Boots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_chain_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tarvus's Poison-Scarred Boots</span></a>. They are BoE and therefore possible to purchase on the auction house if you can't find Tarvus yourself.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Feet Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74253/enchant-boots-lavawalker">
