<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-balance-druid-dps">Rings for Balance Druid DPS</h4>Our two best rings are both hard to get. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64904/ring-of-the-boy-emperor">
<img alt="Ring of the Boy Emperor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_ring-of-the-boyemperor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of the Boy Emperor</span></a> is from archaeology and is random to get. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67129/signet-of-high-arcanist-savor">
<img alt="Signet of High Arcanist Savor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_pearlring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of High Arcanist Savor</span></a> is a world drop and also random to get or expensive on the auction house. This leaves only two options who are identical in stats, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62352/diamants-ring-of-temperance">
<img alt="Diamant's Ring of Temperance" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_70.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Diamant's Ring of Temperance</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56333/rose-quartz-band">
<img alt="Rose Quartz Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_68.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rose Quartz Band</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Ring Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74217/enchant-ring-intellect">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Intellect</span></a> -  Only Enchanters may apply Ring Enchants on their own rings.<div class="pad"></div>
