<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Balance Druid DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="weapons-for-balance-druid-dps">Weapons for Balance Druid DPS</h4>For pre-raid weapons, our best choices are by far the two archaeology staffs, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64489/staff-of-sorcerer-thane-thaurissan">
<img alt="Staff of Sorcerer-Thane Thaurissan" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_staffofsorcerer_than-thaurissan.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Staff of Sorcerer-Thane Thaurissan</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64880/staff-of-ammunae">
<img alt="Staff of Ammunae" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_staff-of-ammunrae.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Staff of Ammunae</span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64489/staff-of-sorcerer-thane-thaurissan">
<img alt="Staff of Sorcerer-Thane Thaurissan" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_staffofsorcerer_than-thaurissan.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Staff of Sorcerer-Thane Thaurissan</span></a> is stronger by an incredibly slim margin, so either one is fine. Should you lack the staffs, then you will generally want to run a main-hand + off-hand combination because of the off-hand enchant giving a slight edge to this type of combo. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=57872/scepter-of-power">
<img alt="Scepter of Power" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_1h_cataclysm_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scepter of Power</span></a> being our best main hand in pre-raid.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74242/enchant-weapon-power-torrent">
