<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hand-items-for-balance-druid-dps">Off-Hand Items for Balance Druid DPS</h4>For off-hand, your best option is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67149/heartbound-tome">
<img alt="Heartbound Tome" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_book_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heartbound Tome</span></a> which is a rare world drop. If you can't find it or afford it, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=57924/apple-bent-bough">
<img alt="Apple-Bent Bough" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_08.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Apple-Bent Bough</span></a> is your next best option. Other off-hands of same ilvl for some reason have lower stats and should therefore not be considered.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Off-Hand Enchant:</b> <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74235/enchant-off-hand-superior-intellect">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Off-Hand - Superior Intellect</span></a>
