<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="relic-for-balance-druid-dps">Relic for Balance Druid DPS</h4>You will want either <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56350/book-of-dark-prophecies">
<img alt="Book of Dark Prophecies" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_book_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Book of Dark Prophecies</span></a>, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56372/captured-lightning">
<img alt="Captured Lightning" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_khoriumpowercore.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Captured Lightning</span></a> or <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63487/book-of-the-well-sung-song">
<img alt="Book of the Well Sung Song" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_book_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Book of the Well Sung Song</span></a> depending on if you need hit. Other options of same ilvl has slightly less stats so you will want to avoid those.<div class="pad"></div>
